SUMMARY:Weekday Dawn Laps in Central Park (NYCC) — New York\, NY
LOCATION:Central Park (the public ride page gives no meeting point)
DESCRIPTION:Pace: Lap times from 16:00 (A\, about 22 mph) to 29:00 (C\, a
 bout 12 mph).\nSchedule: Monday to Thursday before work. Several groups 
 start between 5:40 and 6:50 am\, sorted by lap time. A-level laps at 5:4
 0 am on Tuesdays and Thursdays\, B-level laps at 6:05 am on Tuesdays and
  Thursdays\, Recovery Laps on Mondays at 6:25 am\, a slower C group on T
 hursdays at 6:45 am. Each ride is two to four laps\, 12 to 24 miles.\nCo
 nfirm with the host before you go.\nhttps://cycleforchange.org/rides/new
 -york-ny-nycc-weekday-dawn-laps-central-park/
